  "notes": [
    "You need GTA V Enhanced on Steam (GTA5_Enhanced.exe; not the Legacy edition) and Minecraft: Java Edition, on Windows. Install Script Hook V for your exact Enhanced build yourself: copy ScriptHookV.dll, dinput8.dll and xinput1_4.dll into the GTA V Enhanced folder.",
    "Story mode only: the mod switches itself off in GTA Online (\"MINECRAFT PASSTHROUGH DISABLED IN GTA ONLINE\") and BattlEye stays off while installed. Back up your saves first. Esc shows GTA's pause menu with Minecraft hidden; Resume brings Steve back.",
    "Both games run at once, so CPU and GPU load is high. Tested upstream on Enhanced 1.0.1158.16 only. The local link has no password while Minecraft runs. Beta (experimental upstream): report bugs to the author with the Report a bug link."
  ]
